      <title>$:/plugins/Telumire/PLM</title>
      <description></description>
      <category></category>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><p><h2>0.0.6</h2></p><p>Added gatha</p><p><h2>0.0.5</h2></p><p>Updated <a class="tc-tiddlylink tc-tiddlylink-resolves" href="https://outback-matrix-33.tiddlyhost.com#%24%3A%2Fplugins%2FTelumire%2FPLM%2FViewTemplateTitleFilters%2Fnav">$:/plugins/Telumire/PLM/ViewTemplateTitleFilters/nav</a> to use list-before</p><p><h2>0.0.4</h2></p><ul><li>Added plugin library generation</li></ul><p><h2>0.0.3</h2></p><ul><li>Improved the tabs in the plugin viewer<ul><li>Added history tab + version increment</li><li>The history editor area use the editor macro to enable keyboard shortcuts</li><li>Empty tabs are hidden</li><li>The first non-empty tab from the tablist will be displayed by default</li></ul></li><li>Drag&amp;drop from the PLM plugin list or single plugin view now properly include the extra tiddlers</li><li>Custom <a class="tc-tiddlylink tc-tiddlylink-resolves" href="https://outback-matrix-33.tiddlyhost.com#%24%3A%2Fplugins%2FTelumire%2FPLM%2FViewTemplate%2Ftitle%2Fnav">title view template</a> to navigate plugins content</li></ul></p>]]></content:encoded>
